WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.800
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.200
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:24.120
You are my sun now

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:28.500
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.510
no matter who you are

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:36.930
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:45.640
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:51.030
is clear again

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:56.360
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:59.910
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:05.250
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:08.920
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:16.800
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:23.560
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:30.940
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:38.280
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:57.530
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:02.810
<i>I'm travelling with Jasmine and Barda to take back the gems that were stolen by the Shadow Lord.</i>

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:04.750
<i>And there are only two gems left!</i>

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:10.860
<i>However, the Shadow Lord is now hunting for a boy, a man and a wild girl with a black bird.</i>

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:15.440
<i>Why am I the 'wild one', anyway?
Honestly, the Shadow Lord has no taste.</i>

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:19.340
<i>Our journey is sure to become
more perilous from now on!</i>

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:24.740
<i>Right now, we're headed to the Maze of the Beast, where the sixth gem is hidden!</i>

00:02:38.310 --> 00:02:43.360
<i>Lief and the others were confined in a place called the 'testing room' for three whole days,</i>

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:48.960
<i>in order to determine whether they
would 'return to their Ol forms' or not.</i>

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:01.420
So boring! If you can turn into Ols, then just change already, would you?!

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:06.550
Yeah, honestly. Even though I've finally been reunited with Lief, to think that it would turn out like this...

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:10.000
What, are you planning on
deceiving him all over again?

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:14.450
How rude! I'm really in love with Lief, you know!

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:16.200
I wonder about that.

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:25.000
<i>Their meal on the first day was delivered by Barda's
acquaintance from when he was still a guard at Del Palace,</i>

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:26.800
<i>Jinks the Entertainer.</i>

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:30.100
Really, it's been so long
since I last saw you, Barda.

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:34.000
I thought for sure that you
had been dead for a long time.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:42.900
I used to hear people touting the Del Palace guards to be the strongest and bravest warriors in the land.

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:48.900
But, all of them have since been annihilated following the Shadow Lord's invasion, haven't they?

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:52.430
So, why are you still alive?

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:53.970
What are you trying to say?

00:03:53.970 --> 00:04:01.780
Nothing in particular. I just wonder if perhaps that quiet man over there has some connection with the Shadow Lord.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:03.900
What the hell are you saying?!

00:04:04.270 --> 00:04:09.940
Otherwise, why else would Doom suspect you three to be Ols and confine you here?

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:11.960
We told you that we're not Ols!

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:15.300
Oh really? I wouldn't be so sure about that.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.830
Leave it be, Jasmine.

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:21.200
We'll be in the clear in three days
once they see the truth anyway.

00:04:25.550 --> 00:04:31.600
<i>Ol, a monster that is able to
shapeshift into any living being.</i>

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:37.310
<i>However, their weakness is that they begin to Tremor after three days,</i>

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:40.080
<i>and become unable to maintain
their disguised form.</i>

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:44.800
Right, so see you in three days.

00:05:17.070 --> 00:05:18.910
Guys, here's some food.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:21.670
Dain? Is that you?

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:24.130
Is your arm feeling better now?

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:27.600
Yeah. Thanks to you, I was
able to get a good rest.

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:30.290
Either way, this is all very weird.

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:31.250
What do you mean?

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:35.700
It's the fact that Doom has to
confine you all here for three days.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:41.580
<i>Through Dain, Lief and the others
were let in on a shocking truth.</i>

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:46.820
<i>It seemed that Doom was able
to discern an Ol's true form.</i>

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:52.100
<i>And for that reason, there should be no real need to confine them here at their expense.</i>

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:55.530
<i>But, Lief realised something.</i>

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:06.300
<i>He recalled a message written in blood on the wall of a cave during their journey to Dread Mountain.</i>

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:13.000
Dain, do you think it's possible that Doom has been to the Shadowlands before?

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:18.900
Yeah. That was where he got the ability to identify Ols at a glance, or so I heard.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:22.600
I bet he confined us here

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:27.300
because he didn't want others to know that <i>he's</i> the one who has a relationship with the Shadow Lord!

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:31.270
That's definitely possible, if he really
can identify Ols at a glance.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:36.300
Then allow me to enlighten you fools.

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:40.740
There are some Ols in this world
that even I can't discern.

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:43.100
What's more,

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:48.000
those Ols aren't just limited to taking the forms of the living; they can even transform into chairs or books.

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:48.900
That can't be!

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:54.300
Besides, you lot have figured out
one of the Resistance's secrets.

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:56.880
So we need to be extra careful
when dealing with you.

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:59.600
But surely there's a more
humane way of doing this!

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:04.100
Take off your clothes! I will see for myself whether or not you have the Ol's mark.

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:05.500
No way.

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:09.600
Doom, you might be the leader
of the Resistance, but,

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:13.410
we just don't understand what
you are trying to achieve here!

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:16.100
Besides, we're not Resistance members either.

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:19.300
There's no real need for us to obey your orders.

00:07:20.010 --> 00:07:22.000
I am the law here.

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:28.220
What's all this for?

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:30.750
Just behave yourselves and
nothing will go wrong.

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:42.090
What, you wanna go?

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:45.920
You'll get hurt if you make the
Great Glock angry, you know?

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:48.800
Please stop, Lief. I don't
want to see you get hurt.

00:07:49.140 --> 00:07:53.150
Let's just fight the Shadow Lord together as part of the Resistance, okay?

00:07:53.150 --> 00:07:56.100
But this way of doing things just isn't right!

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:57.810
Save your excuses!

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:01.120
We'll see who's right and wrong
after we fight anyway!

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:03.810
Don't, Glock! You can't hurt them!

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:06.330
I've had enough of this!

00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:08.530
Please calm down, everyone!

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:18.770
We'll see it tomorrow anyway.

00:08:19.410 --> 00:08:20.120
Let's go.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:29.520
Rather than three days, we really
should keep them here for three years!

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:58.000
Lief. Are you awake?

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:00.000
Is that you, Dain?

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:03.400
Please call Doom here.

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:05.800
The three days have since passed!

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:08.550
Yeah. As I thought, Doom still hasn't...

00:09:09.590 --> 00:09:13.460
Dain. Doom was never intending
on letting us go from the start!

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:17.950
Maybe you're right... He has no reason to confine you three here anymore...!

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:19.810
Doom is making a mistake!

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:25.530
Grab on. I'll get you out of here.

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:26.530
Dain...

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:29.900
We don't have much time;
the guards will be returning soon!

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:31.200
Come, hurry!

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:49.380
This should be far enough...

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:52.200
Yeah... we should be safe under this tree...

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:54.400
Thanks, Dain. You've saved us again.

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:59.400
Well, I forgot to mention my condition
for saving you guys, though.

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:03.300
I had a feeling it wouldn't be that simple.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:06.700
I...

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:09.300
I want you to take me to Tora!

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:10.070
Tora?!

00:10:10.620 --> 00:10:13.180
You know about the city of Tora, don't you?

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:17.820
That's the city a few days' walking distance from the River Tor, as far as I know.

00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:21.400
Yeah, but there are some
bandits along that river now,

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:23.900
and I've also heard that it's full of Ols, too.

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:27.840
That's why I need some protection...
I need your help to cross it!

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:34.500
Doom scolded you because
of that before, didn't he?

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:38.610
Why do you want to go there so much
despite knowing how dangerous it'll be?

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:40.450
Just what are you looking for in Tora?

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:43.800
That's... I'm sorry, but I can't tell you just yet...

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:46.400
But, I saved you guys, didn't I?

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:48.900
So you'll take me to Tora, won't you?!

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:52.300
Dain...

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:57.000
Then for what reason did I
save you from that place?!

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:59.500
I have betrayed Doom and the Resistance!

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:01.920
I really do want to return the favour, but...

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:05.660
Ever since I first heard the
rumour about you two...

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:10.200
...the one about a man, a boy,
and a girl with a black bird

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:14.000
who were foiling Shadow Lord's
evil plans all over the kingdom,

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.900
I thought you three would be
the ones who could help me...!

00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:20.500
Was this all just a stupid mistake...?!

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:23.540
Is this just another one of my many blunders?!

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:26.300
What do you mean by that...?

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:29.700
When I was still a child...

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:32.900
...the Grey Guards took my family away!

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:40.500
At that time, my mother hid me in
the closet to keep me safe...

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:13.040
Dad! Mum!

00:12:17.070 --> 00:12:23.000
When I left the closet, my parents were gone; taken by the Grey Guards.

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:28.660
It was just like with me...

00:12:29.550 --> 00:12:32.400
I searched desperately for my parents...

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:34.640
But, they were nowhere to be found.

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:35.500
Dain...

00:12:35.950 --> 00:12:40.550
After that, Doom saved me and made me a member of the Resistance...

00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:42.270
So that's how it happened...

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:44.880
My mother is from the Tora Tribe.

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:49.300
So I thought that I could probably find some clues about my parents if I went to Tora.

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:55.300
Lately, I have been feeling a deep desire in me to return to my birthplace of Tora,

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:57.410
and it's only getting stronger.

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:01.890
I have asked Doom about going
to Tora a number of times now,

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:05.640
but he would always refuse, saying that Tora would only bring danger to the Resistance.

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:10.380
Of course. He couldn't possibly let you endanger the entire Resistance Group, after all.

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:16.100
Yeah. It seems like Tora is currently filled with
Grey Guards, as well as the Shadow Lord's spies.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:22.600
After all, Tora is a land that has strong ties with the royal family of Deltora.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:27.470
I just had a good idea.

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:31.800
Regardless of whatever those two have to say, I'll definitely bring you to Tora.

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:32.940
Really?!

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:52.920
I think I'm going to take a
different route from now on.

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:54.700
What do you mean?

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:56.320
What are you talking about?

00:13:56.320 --> 00:14:00.090
The Shadow Lord's servants in this
area should be looking out for

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:05.360
a group of three that consists of a man, a boy, and a girl with a black bird, right?

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:14.120
Therefore, it'll be better for us to
part ways here, don't you think?

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:18.500
Out of the three of us, the one who stands out the most would be Kree and myself.

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:24.400
So, it's better if we go separate ways.

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:29.410
Hey, Jasmine!

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:31.570
It's too reckless to go on your own!

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:32.960
Wait, Jasmine!

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:40.260
Honestly, what a hardheaded girl...

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:41.880
Jasmine...

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:44.680
Oh well, I suppose we have no
choice but to keep moving, then...

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:49.500
<i>Is this what she meant by her
'good idea to bring me to Tora'...?</i>

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:54.020
Jasmine is a kind girl, isn't she?

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:12.500
Look guys, we should be safe under this tree!

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:17.000
How stupid of me...

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:19.200
I'm by myself now.

00:15:22.110 --> 00:15:24.800
No, I'm not alone. Kree is also here with me.

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.100
And you too, Filli.

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:31.180
We just went back to how things
were in the beginning, I guess.

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:45.000
Now, let's get moving.

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:51.040
Bandits incoming!

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:55.400
Again?!

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.600
How many times has it been now?!

00:16:06.200 --> 00:16:08.200
And yet we've been so careful...

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:10.180
Seems like we've lost our touch.

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:14.350
Up until now, Jasmine always received
info from the trees beforehand,

00:16:14.350 --> 00:16:16.900
while Kree would keep watch from the sky.

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:20.700
We've become too reliant on Jasmine.

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:50.930
But, why would Jasmine do that...?

00:16:51.640 --> 00:16:53.100
That's just how she is.

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:54.600
I guess.

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:04.950
Oh, it's just some geese...

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:09.580
They're Ols!

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:10.590
They've found us!

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:16.710
Why didn't they attack us...?

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:24.510
It's probably because the ones they're looking are a man, a boy, and a wild girl with a black bird with her.

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:28.800
So they have no business with
a man and two boys, then...

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:32.010
Seems like Jasmine's plan does indeed work.

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:32.860
Dain...!

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:36.000
I don't give a damn about that plan!

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:40.240
Jasmine is... Jasmine is like
our family, you know?!

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:43.860
Shouldn't someone who is looking for his family like you understand that more?!

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:49.300
I'm sorry, Lief...

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:54.400
I was only thinking of myself and ended up relying on Jasmine's kindness...

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:58.920
I... I should have taken your feelings
into consideration as well...

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:00.600
Sorry...

00:18:01.150 --> 00:18:03.300
I also went too far.

00:18:03.590 --> 00:18:08.840
I know that Jasmine decided it herself, but I never
expected to be this bothered by her not being around...

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:12.100
Are you worried?

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:15.100
Not really, it's Jasmine after all...

00:18:15.630 --> 00:18:17.900
Don't overdo it; I feel the same way.

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:20.600
This is the first time I've felt this way...

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:23.900
I get this itchy feeling around here, you know?

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:25.520
Next time we meet again...

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:29.100
Yeah, we won't let her out
of our sight ever again.

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:31.660
I've had more than my fill
of this strange feeling!

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:34.100
Yeah...

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:38.320
I envy the relationship you three share...

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:41.500
I'll do my best so you can accept
me as your comrade some day too!

00:18:41.840 --> 00:18:43.480
Alright, let's move on!

00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:46.500
We need to take care, the Ols are everywhere.

00:18:57.420 --> 00:19:00.440
I wonder what Jasmine is doing right now...?

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:01.600
Smoke...?

00:20:01.900 --> 00:20:03.200
There's someone here!

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:04.940
Wait, it might be the Ols!

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:06.390
Or maybe it's Jasmine!

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.500
Either way, don't let your guard down.

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:20.200
I just have to carve the Boss' name here, right?

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:22.800
Yeah.

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:37.730
Those guys...! Are they trying to mimic the Shadow Lord's way of doing things?!

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:42.600
It's so that they can make it clear that
this place is the turf of their bandit group.

00:20:43.030 --> 00:20:46.620
Then, they also want people know that they aren't ruled by the Shadow Lord?

00:20:46.620 --> 00:20:51.100
Well, in a sense, they are also people who fight the Shadow Lord, I suppose.

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:51.870
You're wrong!

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:55.100
Aren't these people humans too?!

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:59.390
And yet, they murder and rob
other humans in times like these?!

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:01.200
How could they be so cruel...?!

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:04.560
Lief!!

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:06.900
Huh?

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:07.570
What was that?

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:10.350
So there was still a survivor, huh?!

00:21:14.300 --> 00:21:15.680
Ouch!!

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:16.610
You bastard!!

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:22.800
You little...!

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:31.400
Ouch, ouch!

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:34.200
Hey, you guys!!

00:21:35.590 --> 00:21:37.100
Don't you think this is over!

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:41.010
And the same to you!!

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:44.900
Those dirty bandits! Don't they
realise that we're all human?!

00:21:45.340 --> 00:21:47.500
We're all human beings!!

00:21:49.150 --> 00:21:50.100
Lief...

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:55.230
Have you calmed down?

00:21:55.900 --> 00:21:57.800
Y...Yeah...

00:21:59.820 --> 00:22:06.550
Once there was an Ol-io, Jolly-wolly Ol-io,

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:13.820
Hey! Once there was an Ol-io, Fearsome as could be!

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:20.350
I said to that Ol-io, Jolly-wolly Ol-io,

00:22:20.350 --> 00:22:24.390
Hey! I said to that Ol-io,

00:22:24.390 --> 00:22:27.710
You don’t bother me!

00:22:38.620 --> 00:22:47.840
How long has it truly been, I wonder?

00:22:47.840 --> 00:22:57.770
I've been watching the moon all this time, bathing in its light

00:22:57.770 --> 00:23:05.190
As we moved closer, a goddess passed over us

00:23:05.190 --> 00:23:14.870
And just like that, my little dream was carried away

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:20.540
I saw you when I looked to the night sky

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:25.130
Now that I think of it, your name was written there too

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:29.420
Above me, a shooting star

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:32.840
fades into the distance

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:38.520
When the moonlight starts to wane

00:23:38.520 --> 00:23:43.140
I stand under the lazy morning's light

00:23:44.100 --> 00:23:47.480
And when that same moon rises

00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:56.320
I'll start moving all over again

00:24:07.300 --> 00:24:08.100
<i>Ol.</i>

00:24:08.990 --> 00:24:11.220
<i>A monster from the Shadowlands.</i>

00:24:11.220 --> 00:24:14.600
<i>A grade 3 Ol, a creation of the
Shadow Lord's evil magic,</i>

00:24:14.600 --> 00:24:19.880
<i>can travel alone and their transformations are
completely indistinguishable from the real thing.</i>

00:24:20.580 --> 00:24:26.600
We got on a steamboat, as it's said to be the most convenient way to get to Tora, Dain's destination.

00:24:26.900 --> 00:24:29.900
There sure are many different
sorts of people on this ship...

00:24:29.900 --> 00:24:31.500
Wait, isn't that...?

00:24:30.900 --> 00:24:34.820
The River Queen

00:24:32.250 --> 00:24:34.420
Next time, 'The River Queen'.

00:24:49.840 --> 00:24:52.840
Typesetting

00:24:49.840 --> 00:24:54.970
See you next time
